ce","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_DOCSE130115NC0077_1301_NNG15SC39B_8000"},{"internal_id":292214469,"Award ID":"9531CB19F0018","Award Amount":7190.06,"Description":"ENTELLITRAK ENHANCEMENTS - SEPARATION OF FMLA&RA CASES","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Consumer Financial Protection Bureau","awarding_agency_id":1158,"agency_slug":"consumer-financial-protection-bureau","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_9531CB19F0018_955F_9531CB18A0004_955F"},{"internal_id":277314089,"Award ID":"12314418F0622","Award Amount":7200.0,"Description":"THE CONTRACTOR WORKS TO DESIGN, IMPLEMENT AND CONFIGURE THE PROJECT SERVER TIME CARD MODEL TO PROVIDE TASK ACCOUNTING FOR CEC PROJECTS. THE CONTACTOR IDENTIFIES CUSTOMERS' INFORMATION SYSTEMS REQUIREMENTS THROUGH CONSTRUCTIVE COLLABORATION WITH DEPARTMENTAL STAKEHOLDERS AND OTHER STAKEHOLDERS AT FEDERAL AGENCIES.  THE CONTRACTOR ASSIST'S THE PROGRAM MANAGEMENT BRANCH AND PROJECT TEAMS COMPRISED OF BUSINESS AND TECHNICAL REPRESENTATIVES TO IMPLEMENT A TIME CARD ACCOUNTING SOLUTION.  THE CONTRACTOR DEVELOPS AN IT PROJECT PLANS, GATE REVIEWS, RISK MONITORS AND EXPENDITURE REPORTING NECESSARY TO EFFECTIVELY IMPLEMENT THE TIME CARD ACCOUNTING.  REPORTS ON IT PROJECT STATUS TO BUSINESS SPONSORS AND OVERSIGHT BODIES.  AS NEEDED, ASSISTS AND/OR LEADS IN THE DEVELOPMENT OF PLANS TO MITIGATE RISK AFFECTING SCHEDULE AND BUDGET.  AS NEEDED, RECOMMENDS TIMELY CORRECTIVE ACTIONS TO ADDRESS SCHEDULE OR BUDGET VARIANCES BEFORE THEY THREATEN PROJECT SUCCESS.  THE CONTRACTOR DEVELOPS SOP'S (STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURES) FOR CEC STAFF TO PROPERLY USE PROJECT SERVER FOR TIME CARD ACCOUNTING.  THE CONTRACTOR FACILITATES REGULAR REVIEW OF PROJECTS IN THE CEC PORTFOLIO AND PROVIDES PMO DUTIES SUPPORT OF THE PROJECT SERVER TIME CARD MODEL ALIGNMENT; ESTABLISHING THE REVIEW PROCEDURES, TEMPLATES, AND TOOLS; PROVIDING SUPPORT FOR PROJECT TEAMS TO PREPARE AND PARTICIPATE IN THE REVIEWS; RECOMMENDING ALTERNATE PROPOSALS TO ENHANCE PROJECT SERVER PERFORMANCE OR REMEDIATE UNDER-PERFORMANCE.  THE CONTRACTOR PREPARES STATUS REPORTS, HOST MEETINGS, CREATE MEETING AGENDAS AND TECHNICAL PROGRAM PRESENTATIONS FOR UPPER-LEVEL MANAGEMENT AND SPONSORS. THE CONTRACTOR WORKS CLOSELY WITH THE PROGRAM MANAGEMENT BRANCH TEAM TO ENSURE GOOD COMMUNICATION AND PROTECT THE INTEREST OF THE USDA.  THE CONTRACTOR UTILIZES MS POWER POINT, WORD, MS PROJECT, EXCEL TO CREATE DOCUMENTS, PRESENTATIONS AND PROJECT PLANS AS NEEDED.  THE CONTRACTOR WORKS TO PROVIDE PROGRAM/PROJECT MANAGEMENT FOR THE PROJECT SERVER TIME CARD ACCOUNTING PROJECTS AND INITIATIVES.  THIS CONSIST OF HOSTING PROJECT MEETINGS, WEEKLY ACTIVITY REPORTING, PROJECT SCHEDULE CREATION, DEVELOPMENT OF PRESENTATIONS, LEADS CROSS CEC DIVISION PROJECT TASKS IF NECESSARY AND PROJECT COORDINATION WITH TEAM LEADS. PROVIDE STATUS REPORTS AND WRITTEN BEST PRACTICE RECOMMENDATION TO THE PROJECT MANAGEMENT BRANCH. THE CONTRACTOR SHALL PROVIDE TECHNICAL WRITTEN DOCUMENTATION BASED ON PROCEDURES, BEST PRACTICE AND HOW TO GUIDES RELATED TO PROJECT SERVER 2016 AS NEEDED FOR THE TIME CARD MODEL OPERATIONS AND MANAGEMENT.","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Agriculture","awarding_agency_id":95,"agency_slug":"department-of-agriculture","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_12314418F0622_1205_AG3144B170001_1205"},{"internal_id":291223714,"Award ID":"70FBR920F00000073","Award Amount":7205.04,"Description":"TO PROCURE WIRELESS SERVICES IN SUPPORT OF DR4404 CNMI DISASTER","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Homeland Security","awarding_agency_id":766,"agency_slug":"department-of-homeland-security","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_70FBR920F00000073_7022_70FA3018D00000003_7022"},{"internal_id":291215630,"Award ID":"70FBR219F00000009","Award Amount":7214.17,"Description":"ACTIVATE 18 AT&T PHONE FROM THE ATTACHED LIST","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Homeland Security","awarding_agency_id":766,"agency_sl